    "body": "@kennyishihara yeah that fix didn't work for me either sadly. I am able to prove that this issue isn't a starship problem however. Setting (the prompt that I get using `starship prompt` + `starship prompt --right`):\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nPROMPT=\"%{%}❯%{%} \"\r\nRPROMPT=\" {%}~/src/agda/%{%}%{%}agda-stdlib%{%}1%{%}%{%}%{%}(%{%}%{%}b85c5d1%{%}%{%} 🏷  v1.7.15%{%%{%})%{%} at %{%}13:16:25%{%}\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nis sufficient to reproduce the issue using my zsh/iTerm2 environment. If I get annoyed enough about this I will create an upstream issue with either/both of those.",
